						<p class="pDate">Friday, January 10, 2003</p>
						<p class="pTitle">BUY/SELL Section 
						</p>
						<p class=pText>
						BUY and SELL at your own risk.<BR><BR>There are alot of scammers out there. The Buy and Sell section was originally intended for in game trading only, but has been over run by plat and account selling for quite some time.  The Buy and Sell section is just a message board that anyone can post on.  There is no way for us to verify what people are selling or whether or not it's a scam.  Most likely we'll have to remove this section from our web site. Randomly I will be deleting all account and plat for cash sales in the list. I'd like to encourge people to continue using this for in game trading if this can not be done I will remove this section.<BR><BR>If you have any feelings about how the Buy/Sell section should be handled please post a comment to this news article.
						<br>
						 - Ganza<BR><BR>
						</p>
						<p class="sHeader">Comments</p>
						
							<p class="pDate">Friday, January 10, 2003</p>
							
							<p class="pTitle">Buy/Sell 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							In my opinion the board is a good idea. Yes there are scammers out there. But there are scammers on say.. playerauctions and no one can do anything about it. When you decide u want to trade / sell your everquest account you are taking a risk. Everyone kno
							<br>
							 - Tuhg<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">Buy/Sell 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							And BTW you can get scammed just easily by the trading of accounts or pp that you still leaving listed as a dollar for item deal.
							<br>
							 - PPseller<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">Buy/Sell 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							I agree with Tuhg. And at least here, with the help of others, you can kinda get a heads up on the scammers, on playerauctions or ebay you cant.
							<br>
							 - PPseller<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">Remove the buy/sell 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							Most everyone knows trading and selling items and plat and accounts ruins the server. Even if you've been playing for years you probly wont play the class you traded for at high levels, and the people you would group or raid with will suffer for it. Earn 
							<br>
							 - Retnaburn<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">why not? 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							Its the people's choice to buy/sell/trade accounts, I say just leave it be and if someone gets an account stolen at least ban the stealers ip from the boards. Thanks.
							<br>
							 - boffo234<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">Buying/Selling Accts 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							Ganza, I agree with you.  The other thing that is really discouraging is to see all the posts on this section...The News Section... for accounts for sale and angry words about "don't buy from this person because..." <BR>
							<br>
							 - Adrastea<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">Why not? 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							Because it's against the EULA. You know, that thing you click I Agree on every time you log in? Plus, how would you know if someone stole an account or not to be able to ban their IP?
							<br>
							 - Retnaburn<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
							<center>
							<img src=images/redline.gif height=1 width=100%>				
							</center>
							
							<p class="pTitle">Don't wory 
							</p>
							<p class=pText>
							I wouldn't worry too much about this if i were you, with eq adventures, and eq2 coming out it shouldn't be such a big deal anymore.  all those "Power gamers" who are making this game bad will be moving on.
							<br>
							 - mememe<BR><BR>
							</p>
							
